{"seq":2,"slug":"rabbitmq-patterns","title":"RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/rabbitmq-patterns","wordCount":858,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rabbitmq-模式与高可用配置\">RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置</h1><p>RabbitMQ 基于 AMQP 协议，采用<strong>Exchange → Binding → Queue</strong> 的路由模型，与 Kafka 的&quot;发布到分区&quot;截然不同。它的核心优势在于灵活的路由规则、消息优先级队列和成熟的确认机制。RabbitMQ 更适合需要复杂路由逻辑、任务分发和 RPC 模式的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Exchange</td>\n<td>接收生产者消息并按规则路由到 Queue 的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Queue</td>\n<td>存储消息的缓冲区，消费者从 Queue 取消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Binding</td>\n<td>Exchange 与 Queue 之间的路由规则绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Routing Key</td>\n<td>消息的路由标识，Exchange 据此决定发往哪个 Queue</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Channel</td>\n<td>连接内的虚拟通道，多个 Channel 共享一个 TCP 连接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"exchange-路由模型\">Exchange 路由模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[Producer] --&gt;|routing_key: order.created| EX[Exchange]&#10;    EX --&gt;|Binding: order.*| Q1[Queue: orders.processing]&#10;    EX --&gt;|Binding: order.created| Q2[Queue: notifications]&#10;    EX --&gt;|Binding: #| Q3[Queue: audit.log]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; C1[消费者: 订单处理]&#10;    Q2 --&gt; C2[消费者: 通知服务]&#10;    Q3 --&gt; C3[消费者: 审计服务]\">flowchart LR\n    P[Producer] --&gt;|routing_key: order.created| EX[Exchange]\n    EX --&gt;|Binding: order.*| Q1[Queue: orders.processing]\n    EX --&gt;|Binding: order.created| Q2[Queue: notifications]\n    EX --&gt;|Binding: #| Q3[Queue: audit.log]\n    Q1 --&gt; C1[消费者: 订单处理]\n    Q2 --&gt; C2[消费者: 通知服务]\n    Q3 --&gt; C3[消费者: 审计服务]</pre><p><strong>四种 Exchange 类型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Exchange 类型</th>\n<th>路由规则</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Direct</strong></td>\n<td>routing_key 精确匹配</td>\n<td>任务队列、点对点分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Fanout</strong></td>\n<td>广播到所有绑定队列（忽略 routing_key）</td>\n<td>事件广播、缓存失效通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Topic</strong></td>\n<td>routing_key 通配符（<code>*</code> 单词，<code>#</code> 多词）</td>\n<td>分类事件路由</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Headers</strong></td>\n<td>根据消息 header 属性匹配</td>\n<td>复杂条件路由（较少用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消息确认机制\">消息确认机制</h2><p>RabbitMQ 的确认机制分<strong>消费者确认</strong>和<strong>生产者确认</strong>两侧：</p>\n<p><strong>消费者确认（Consumer ACK）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"msgs, _ := ch.Consume(&quot;orders.processing&quot;, &quot;&quot;, false, false, false, false, nil)&#10;&#10;for d := range msgs {&#10;    if err := processOrder(d.Body); err != nil {&#10;        // 处理失败：重新入队（requeue=true）或转 DLQ（requeue=false）&#10;        d.Nack(false, shouldRequeue(err))&#10;        continue&#10;    }&#10;    d.Ack(false) // 成功处理，确认消息&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msgs, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Consume</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.processing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msgs {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processOrder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d.Body); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 处理失败：重新入队（requeue=true）或转 DLQ（requeue=false）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        d.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Nack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shouldRequeue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    d.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 成功处理，确认消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>生产者确认（Publisher Confirms）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"ch.Confirm(false) // 开启确认模式&#10;&#10;confirmCh := ch.NotifyPublish(make(chan amqp.Confirmation, 1))&#10;&#10;err := ch.Publish(&quot;orders&quot;, &quot;order.created&quot;, false, false, amqp.Publishing{&#10;    ContentType:  &quot;application/json&quot;,&#10;    DeliveryMode: amqp.Persistent,&#10;    Body:         body,&#10;})&#10;&#10;select {&#10;case confirm := &lt;-confirmCh:&#10;    if !confirm.Ack {&#10;        // 消息未被 Broker 确认，需重试&#10;        log.Println(&quot;消息未确认，准备重试&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;case &lt;-time.After(5 * time.Second):&#10;    log.Println(&quot;确认超时&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Confirm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 开启确认模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">confirmCh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NotifyPublish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Confirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publishing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ContentType:  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DeliveryMode: amqp.Persistent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Body:         body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> confirm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">confirmCh:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">confirm.Ack {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 消息未被 Broker 确认，需重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"消息未确认，准备重试\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.Second):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Println</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"确认超时\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消息持久化\">消息持久化</h2><p>要保证 RabbitMQ 重启后消息不丢失，需要三层持久化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 1. 声明持久化队列&#10;ch.QueueDeclare(&quot;orders&quot;, true, false, false, false, nil)&#10;// durable=true ↑&#10;&#10;// 2. 声明持久化 Exchange&#10;ch.ExchangeDeclare(&quot;orders_exchange&quot;, &quot;topic&quot;, true, false, false, false, nil)&#10;// durable=true ↑&#10;&#10;// 3. 发送持久化消息&#10;ch.Publish(&quot;orders_exchange&quot;, &quot;order.created&quot;, false, false, amqp.Publishing{&#10;    DeliveryMode: amqp.Persistent, // ← 持久化消息&#10;    ContentType:  &quot;application/json&quot;,&#10;    Body:         body,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 声明持久化队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// durable=true ↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 声明持久化 Exchange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ExchangeDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders_exchange\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// durable=true ↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 发送持久化消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders_exchange\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publishing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DeliveryMode: amqp.Persistent, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ← 持久化消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ContentType:  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Body:         body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"优先级队列\">优先级队列</h2><p>RabbitMQ 支持消息优先级（0–255），高优先级消息在队列中先被消费：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 声明支持优先级的队列（最大优先级 10）&#10;ch.QueueDeclare(&quot;orders&quot;, true, false, false, false, amqp.Table{&#10;    &quot;x-max-priority&quot;: 10,&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 发送高优先级消息&#10;ch.Publish(&quot;&quot;, &quot;orders&quot;, false, false, amqp.Publishing{&#10;    Priority: 8, // 高优先级&#10;    Body:     body,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 声明支持优先级的队列（最大优先级 10）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"x-max-priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发送高优先级消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Publishing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Priority: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 高优先级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Body:     body,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优先级应用场景</strong>：VIP 用户订单优先处理、紧急告警消息优先消费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集群与镜像队列\">集群与镜像队列</h2><p>RabbitMQ 集群实现高可用，队列默认只存在于一个节点。<strong>镜像队列（Mirrored Queues）</strong> 将队列数据同步到多个节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 设置策略：所有匹配 &quot;ha.&quot; 前缀的队列启用镜像到所有节点&#10;rabbitmqctl set_policy ha-all &quot;^ha\\.&quot; \\&#10;  &#39;{&quot;ha-mode&quot;:&quot;all&quot;,&quot;ha-sync-mode&quot;:&quot;automatic&quot;}&#39; \\&#10;  --priority 1 --apply-to queues\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置策略：所有匹配 \"ha.\" 前缀的队列启用镜像到所有节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rabbitmqctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set_policy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ha-all</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"^ha\\.\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '{\"ha-mode\":\"all\",\"ha-sync-mode\":\"automatic\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --priority</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --apply-to</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> queues</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Quorum Queue（推荐替代镜像队列）</strong>：RabbitMQ 3.8+ 引入基于 Raft 的 Quorum Queue，比传统镜像队列更安全可靠：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"ch.QueueDeclare(&quot;orders.quorum&quot;, true, false, false, false, amqp.Table{&#10;    &quot;x-queue-type&quot;: &quot;quorum&quot;,&#10;    &quot;x-quorum-initial-group-size&quot;: 3,&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueueDeclare</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"orders.quorum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">amqp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Table</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"x-queue-type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quorum\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"x-quorum-initial-group-size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>镜像队列</th>\n<th>Quorum Queue</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性算法</td>\n<td>异步镜像</td>\n<td>Raft（强一致）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脑裂风险</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>稍低（共识开销）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐状态</td>\n<td>已不推荐</td>\n<td>推荐（3.8+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"连接与通道管理\">连接与通道管理</h2><p>RabbitMQ 连接（Connection）是 TCP 连接，通道（Channel）是连接内的虚拟通道——每个消费者应使用独立通道，但共享连接以节省资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 最佳实践：单连接 + 多通道&#10;conn, _ := amqp.Dial(&quot;amqp://user:pass@localhost:5672/&quot;)&#10;defer conn.Close()&#10;&#10;// 为每个 goroutine 创建独立通道&#10;ch1, _ := conn.Channel()&#10;ch2, _ := conn.Channel()&#10;defer ch1.Close()&#10;defer ch2.Close()&#10;&#10;// 设置 QoS：每次预取 10 条，避免消费者积压&#10;ch1.Qos(10, 0, false)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最佳实践：单连接 + 多通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">conn, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amqp.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Dial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"amqp://user:pass@localhost:5672/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 为每个 goroutine 创建独立通道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch1, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch2, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ch2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置 QoS：每次预取 10 条，避免消费者积压</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ch1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Qos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与-kafka-对比选型\">与 Kafka 对比选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>RabbitMQ</th>\n<th>Kafka</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消息保留</td>\n<td>消费后删除</td>\n<td>按时间/大小保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由复杂度</td>\n<td>强（4种Exchange）</td>\n<td>弱（仅 topic + key）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>吞吐量</td>\n<td>中（10万/秒级）</td>\n<td>高（百万/秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息顺序</td>\n<td>单队列内有序</td>\n<td>分区内有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>极低（亚毫秒）</td>\n<td>低（毫秒级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消费回放</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>任务队列、RPC</td>\n<td>事件流、日志收集</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键实践清单\">关键实践清单</h2><ul>\n<li>生产环境使用 Quorum Queue（3.8+），替代已不推荐的镜像队列</li>\n<li>始终开启 Publisher Confirms，确认消息真正落地到 Broker</li>\n<li>设置合理的 QoS prefetch（10–100），防止单消费者积压过多未确认消息</li>\n<li>所有队列和消息均设为持久化（durable + persistent），防止重启丢失</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>RabbitMQ 的 Exchange 路由模型提供了 Kafka 无法比拟的路由灵活性，适合需要复杂分发逻辑的任务队列场景。Quorum Queue 是现代高可用配置的首选，替代已不推荐的镜像队列。生产者确认 + 消费者 ACK + 消息持久化三层组合，构成消息不丢失的完整保障。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RabbitMQ 模式与高可用配置","id":"rabbitmq-模式与高可用配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Exchange 路由模型","id":"exchange-路由模型"},{"level":2,"text":"消息确认机制","id":"消息确认机制"},{"level":2,"text":"消息持久化","id":"消息持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级队列","id":"优先级队列"},{"level":2,"text":"集群与镜像队列","id":"集群与镜像队列"},{"level":2,"text":"连接与通道管理","id":"连接与通道管理"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Kafka 对比选型","id":"与-kafka-对比选型"},{"level":2,"text":"关键实践清单","id":"关键实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Kafka 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/kafka-in-depth"},"next":{"title":"Redis Streams 与 NATS 消息系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/message-queue-async-patterns/systems/redis-streams-nats"}}